      "description": "Trick your friends with a ‘detector’ that you secretly control.\n\nPress the screen harder to control the readout and realistic 'geiger-counter' sound.\n\nUse it on your friends to measure their style, intelligence, and wit.  \nWave it around when you ‘detect' BS, bros, or sheer brilliance.\nDetect engrams, elronds, megafaunas, and more.\n\nIt’s amazing what your phone can 'detect'!\n\nWorks on old and new iPhones, even those without 3D-touch!\n\n\n\nHow it works:\n\nOn phones with 3D Touch (6s, 7, 8, X, XS), the readout is controlled by measuring the PRESSURE on your screen.\nOn all other phones (iPhone 11 and newer, iPhone 6 and older), the readout is controlled by the SIZE (DIAMETER) of your fingerprint on the screen.\n\nTIP for the fingerprint-size-sensing phones: lay the length of your finger against the screen to get up to and above 100%!\n\nEdit the labels to whatever you like, or leave them blank for versatility.\n\nCan also be used as a 'musical' instrument or for sound effects.\n\nHave fun!",
